  message: "_determine_function_kind now returns (kind, exec_space) tuple where kind is always canonical 'function' and exec_space lives on meta['cuda_execution_space']. language-conventions.yaml's 3 CUDA rules migrated to ^function$ + meta_match, with a 4th rule added for host_device (no YAML rule existed pre-fold). symbol_id discriminator preserved via exec_space string. Legacy meta['is_kernel'] flag retained for kernel_launch edge / GPU-entrypoint consumers. Tests updated: test_cuda_analyzer.py (_by_exec_space helper, 10 sites), BRANCHES_test_cuda.py (8 + 4 unit tests rewritten for tuple shape), test_framework_patterns.py (4 new pinning tests in TestLanguageConventionsMigratedRules + test_enrich_symbols_with_cuda_kernel updated). 10351 tests pass at 100% coverage. Merged in commit c61944805c."  # 5abe
